#. type: Content of: <sect1><title>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:12
#, xml-text
msgid "Acknowledgments"
msgstr "Reconhecimentos"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"We would like to thank the following people and organizations for their "
"contributions toward the BLFS and LFS projects:"
msgstr ""
"Nós gostaríamos de agradecer às seguintes pessoas e organizações pelas "
"contribuições delas para os projetos BLFS e LFS:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:19
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"All those people listed on the Credits page for submitting patches, "
"instructions and corrections to the book.  The former editor would "
"especially like to thank Bruce, Larry and Billy for their enormous inputs to"
" the project."
msgstr ""
"Todas aquelas pessoas listadas na página dos Créditos por enviarem remendos,"
" instruções e correções para o livro. O antigo editor gostaria de agradecer "
"especialmente ao Bruce; ao Larry; e ao Billy pelas enormes contribuições "
"deles para o projeto."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:25
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Jeff Bauman (former co-editor of the book) for his assistance with getting "
"BLFS off the ground."
msgstr ""
"Jeff Bauman (antigo coeditor do livro) pela assistência dele para fazer o "
"BLFS decolar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:gerard@&lfs-domainname;\">Gerard Beekmans</ulink> "
"&lt;gerard &lt;at&gt; &lfs-domainname;&gt; for starting and writing the vast"
" majority of the LFS project."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:gerard@&lfs-domainname;\">Gerard Beekmans</ulink> "
"&lt;gerard &lt;at&gt; &lfs-domainname;&gt; por iniciar e escrever a quase "
"totalidade do projeto LFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:34
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Robert Briggs for donating the &lfs-domainname; and linuxfromscratch.com "
"domain names."
msgstr ""
"Robert Briggs por doar os nomes de domínio &lfs-domainname; e "
"linuxfromscratch.com."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:38
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"DREAMWVR.COM for their sponsorship by donating various resources to the LFS "
"and related sub projects."
msgstr ""
"DREAMWVR.COM pelo patrocínio deles(as), doando vários recursos para o LFS e "
"subprojetos relacionados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Bruce Dubbs for donating the anduin package server and his substantial "
"contribution to the purchase of the new quantum server."
msgstr ""
"Bruce Dubbs por doar o servidor de pacote anduin e a contribuição "
"substancial dele para a compra do novo servidor quantum."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:46
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:garrett@linux.com\">Garrett LeSage</ulink> &lt;garrett "
"&lt;at&gt; linux.com&gt; for creating the LFS banner."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:garrett@linux.com\">Garrett LeSage</ulink> &lt;garrett "
"&lt;at&gt; linux.com&gt; por criar o banner do LFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:50
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:bkenoah@oswd.org\">Frank Skettino</ulink> &lt;bkenoah "
"&lt;at&gt; oswd.org&gt; at <ulink url=\"http://www.oswd.org\">OSWD</ulink> "
"for coming up with the initial design of the LFS and BLFS websites."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:bkenoah@oswd.org\">Frank Skettino</ulink> &lt;bkenoah "
"&lt;at&gt; oswd.org&gt; em <ulink url=\"http://www.oswd.org\">OSWD</ulink> "
"por apresentar o projeto inicial dos sítios da web LFS e BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:56
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:strider@linux.com\">Mark Stone</ulink> &lt;mstone "
"&lt;at&gt; linux.com&gt; for donating the original &lfs-domainname; servers."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:strider@linux.com\">Mark Stone</ulink> &lt;mstone "
"&lt;at&gt; linux.com&gt; por doar os servidores originais &lfs-domainname;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:61
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:highos@&lfs-domainname;\">Jesse Tie-Ten-Quee</ulink> "
"&lt;higho &lt;at&gt; &lfs-domainname;&gt; for answering many questions on "
"IRC, having a great deal of patience and for not killing the former editor "
"for the joke in the original BLFS announcement!"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"mailto:highos@&lfs-domainname;\">Jesse Tie-Ten-Quee</ulink> "
"&lt;higho &lt;at&gt; &lfs-domainname;&gt; por responder a muitas perguntas "
"no IRC, tendo um alto grau de paciência; e por não matar o antigo editor "
"pela piada no anúncio original do BLFS!"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/introduction/welcome/acknowledgments.xml:68
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Countless other people on the various LFS and BLFS mailing lists who are "
"making this book possible by giving their suggestions, testing the book and "
"submitting bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Incontáveis outras pessoas nas várias listas de discussão do LFS e do BLFS "
"que estão tornando este livro possível dando sugestões, testando o livro e "
"apresentando informes de defeitos."

